Package: gpscleaner
Type: Package
Title: 2D Kalman Filter and Interpolation for GPS Trajectory Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Szymon", "Lachowicz",
    email = "01199240@pw.edu.pl",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Szymon Lachowicz [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Szymon Lachowicz <01199240@pw.edu.pl>
Description: Implements advanced tools for geographic coordinate time series 
    processing, integrated with native C code via the .Call interface. It 
    features a two-dimensional Kalman filter designed for noise reduction, 
    anomaly detection, and outlier rejection in GPS trajectories. Additionally, 
    the package provides linear interpolation for handling missing GPS data 
    points along with automated speed recalculation.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
